    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1121">

                <pb facs="1217" n="1205" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg1205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">311.5754 Janko/18</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Attorney General</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Biddle</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-02-18">February 18,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Motor Tank Vessel <hi rendition="#italic">Norsktank</hi> (Ex
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Janko</hi>) Libel of possession of Pankos Operating
                    Company, S.A. and plea of sovereign immunity—Your number Le 311.5754 Janko/6</p>
                <p>The question of immunity of the Norwegian Motor Tank Vessel <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Norsktank</hi> from seizure and arrest in the above
                    proceedings was submitted to the United States District Court for the Eastern
                    District of New York and the United States Circuit Court of Appeals for the
                    Second Circuit and on February 10, 1944, the order of the Court was entered,
                    releasing and discharging the <hi rendition="#italic">Janko</hi> from the
                    custody of the Court.</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer>For the Attorney General, <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis M. Shea</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant Attorney General</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
